{"id":"vod_md_4733","vodId":"4733","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"盾之勇者成名录","name_cn":"盾之勇者成名录","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230912-1/0ec79c174ff728e6cf6c4e92cfb0f734.jpg"},"summary":"岩谷尚文（石川界人 配音）是一个内心里充满了正义感的青年，对世界上发生的很多不公平的事情都深感愤怒。一次偶然中，他被传送到了异世界里，成为了能够使用各种各样不同功能的盾牌的盾之勇者。本以为可以就此展开伸张正义的旅途，哪知道刚刚过去几天，他就经历了战友的背叛，而且丢掉了所有的财物。尚文发誓再也不要信任这个世界里的任何人了。就在这个节骨眼上，尚文的面前出现了一位名为拉芙塔利亚（濑户麻沙美 配音）的少女，拉芙塔利亚是一名奴隶，尚文决定用金钱来换取忠诚将她买下，在相处的过程中，拉芙塔利亚渐渐爱上了自己的主人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-12 08:06:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/Lyzor6w1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/Rp8KPCiI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/X2YpTf8z/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/ufve2oFP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/amDptkHw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/2T0bVB72/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/8Kz81B2M/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/LN4IIa0r/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/fsdIG8UB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/xWpgLZMg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/431WI4fH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/dpENi8iV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/iNtDmbTw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/nr5qiv4c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/ynI7auXL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.mod